      <groundspeak:short_description html="True">&lt;b&gt;12 September 2026, 08:00 - 09:00&lt;/b&gt;</groundspeak:short_description>
      <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;p&gt;Geo Breakfast September&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8 am - 9 am&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please join your fellow cachers for the monthly HyVee Deli Caching Breakfast.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Come enjoy a meal together or just swap stories and adventures from the trail.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The deli is wheelchair accessible and offers three options: a full breakfast menu, purchase something from the store and eat it at the event, or just join us for the fun (no purchase necessary).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*as always, no purchase required to attend*&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional Waypoints&lt;/p&gt;R0BW3WP - HyVee Store&lt;br /&gt;N 41° 15.945 W 096° 02.394&lt;br /&gt;Cafeteria in the HyVee Store&lt;br /&gt;</groundspeak:long_description>
