      <groundspeak:long_description html="True">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e67e22;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:48px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Here&amp;#39;s the scoop&lt;/u&gt;!   &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:20px;"&gt;Come out for geocaching talk with fellow cachers before the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ffffff;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:48px;"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#336600;"&gt;23rd Annual Nebraskache Picnic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h2 style="text-align:center;"&gt;Ice Cream! Burgers! Soda!&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h2 style="text-align:center;"&gt;French Fries! Onions Rings!  You get the picture!&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;As always, no purchase required to attend this event.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Where? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Culver&amp;#39;s &lt;br /&gt;
5010 2nd Ave&lt;br /&gt;
Kearney, NE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Friday, September 11, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;7:30 pm to 8:30 pm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://nebraskache.com/"&gt;&lt;img height="112" src="https://img.geocaching.com/9102f957-c986-41b5-acdb-a076bd017129.jpg" width="224" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;a href="http://nebraskache.com/"&gt;Hosted By A Nebraskache Member&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/107321656812/"&gt;&lt;img height="68" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/gs-geo-images/19b6196d-f1d8-431b-9201-f4069d107ada_l.png" width="213" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center;"&gt;As the geocache event owner, I ensure that these links to a local geocaching group that is active in the community and contributing to geocaching in positive ways. This link has not been checked by Geocaching HQ or by the reviewer.&lt;/p&gt;
</groundspeak:long_description>
